===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small wad of [[fur]] or mass of [[hair]] formed in the [[digestive system]] of a [[cat]] or other [[animal]], from hair [[ingest]]ed while [[groom]]ing.
# {{lb|en|slang|figuratively}} A [[messy]], [[tangled]], [[intractable]] issue.
#: {{ux|en|The contract negotiations are turning into a real '''hairball'''.}}

